  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar on GBV in Africa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Seminarium om k&#xf6;nsrelaterat v&#xe5;ld</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 2-day seminar for experts within the field of gender-based violence in conflict situations will be organised. It will provide an opportunity to share experiences, best practices as well as elaborate steps that need to be taken in order to effectively address the problem. The intended outcome is a contribution to more effective strategies to combat gender-based violence in conflicts in Africa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett 2-dagars seminarium f&#xf6;r experter inom k&#xf6;nsbaserat v&#xe5;ld i konfliktsituationer kommer anordnas som ett tillf&#xe4;lle att dela erfarenheter, best practice liksom utveckla framtida steg f&#xf6;r att bek&#xe4;mpa problemet. Restultat p&#xe5; medell&#xe5;ng sikt &#xe4;r att bidra till effektivare strategier i Afrika f&#xf6;r att bek&#xe4;mpa k&#xf6;nsrelaterat v&#xe5;ld i konfliktsituationer.</narrative>
  </description>
